d run service  to do this we're going to head to the  triggers tab  we're going to start by clicking on add  trigger  we're asked to specify a trigger name  we're going to leave the default  suggested value as is  we'll head to event type where we're  going to pick cloud pops up  this allows us to receive events  published to specific cloud pub sub  topics  we're asked to select a cloud pub sub  topic and i'm going to select one that  i'd already created earlier  as i click on save this will complete  trigger creation  and complete the setup of our event  driven architecture  i am now ready to head over to our cloud  storage bucket  to which i'm going to add the original  image of the family that we showed you  earlier  once again here's the image of the  family  i'm going to take this and drag this  into the cloud storage bucket  now that we've added this image to the  cloud storage bucket it's going to kick  off a series of events  as we described in the setup earlier  if all is well and working well when i  move over to the next tab which  represents the fifth cloud run service  for the user interface  we should see images for each of the  family members along with their  sentiment scores  so let's go take a look  here we are you see images of each of  the family members  the two parents on the right and the two  and the two children on the left  the parents have higher happiness scores  right after their happiness scores they  have neutrality scores  and the two children as you can see from  their facial expressions  have higher neutrality scores followed  by sadness scores  so what did we just see right now  we created an event driven rapid auto  scaling  scale to zero service  we created an event trigger and we  triggered cloud events to be sent  to cloud run services there's a few  key takeaways i'd like you to take away  from today's presentation  you as a user can transform your  company's i.t systems to enable  real-time business  so your customers and business users can  get what they want  when they want it and in doing so this  enables a layer of high value services  that really make a difference to the  bottom line of your business  i invite you to try both offerings we've  discussed today  events for cloud run is in private  preview and you can sign up by going to  bitly  event stash cr events for cloud9 for  anthos is also in private preview  and you can access it at bitly events cr  anthos both offerings are coming to  public preview by the end of september  of this year  and we invite you to join us when they  come to public preview  once again my name is prashant gulati my  email address  is my first name last name at google.com  i would love  to hear from you comments questions and  feedback  thank you very much i hope you enjoy the  rest of next

